cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Myrmidon in your research, please cite it."
title: "Myrmidon: an agent harness for molecular dynamics and QM/MM simulation research"
abstract: >-
  Myrmidon sits between an AI agent and the simulation programs it drives. It owns the
  tools the agent may call, the checks that run before expensive work, and an append-only
  record of everything that happened, so that no number comes from the language model,
  every setting names its source, and a finished study can be replayed from its own
  ledger. It drives GROMACS and MiMiC-coupled CPMD/GROMACS QM/MM, and the force-matching
  tools of MiMiCPy, on a workstation or on a batch cluster.
type: software
